WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.474
Oribrix Vendor Portal course mein aapka welcome hai.

2
00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:07.371
Module one. Vendor console ka poora tour.

3
00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:15.031
Pehle course mein aapne sikha ki vendor apply kaise karta hai, aur admin KYC kaise

4
00:00:15.031 --> 00:00:19.228
Approve karta hai. Ye course theek uske baad se shuru hota hai.

5
00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:23.626
Vendor approve ho chuka hai. Ab vendor roz actually karta kya hai?

6
00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:27.617
Pehle, ye course exactly kahan se shuru hota hai.

7
00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:32.355
Phir vendor console ke left side pe dikhne wale ten sections.

8
00:00:32.805 --> 00:00:36.773
Phir dashboard kaise padhein, uske chaar key numbers ke saatha.

9
00:00:37.223 --> 00:00:40.551
Phir wo words jo is course mein baar baar aayenge.

10
00:00:41.001 --> 00:00:44.116
Aur aakhir mein, kisko kya karne ki permission hai.

11
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.772
Ye vendor ki poori journey hai. Pehle do steps onboarding course mein cover ho chuke

12
00:00:51.772 --> 00:00:55.161
Hain. Ye course uske baad ka sab kuch cover karta hai.

13
00:00:55.611 --> 00:00:59.067
Vendor ne Oribrix pe bechne ke liye apply kiya.

14
00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:03.635
Admin ne documents check kiye, aur KYC approve ho gaya.

15
00:01:04.085 --> 00:01:09.738
Ab vendor ek warehouse add karta hai, yaani wo jagah jahan se maal pick up hota hai.

16
00:01:10.188 --> 00:01:15.777
Phir vendor SKUs add karta hai, yaani master catalog ke products ka stock.

17
00:01:16.227 --> 00:01:21.625
Customers order karte hain, aur vendor order accept, pack aur hand over karta hai.

18
00:01:22.075 --> 00:01:26.593
Aur aakhir mein, vendor ko settlements ke through payment milta hai.

19
00:01:26.593 --> 00:01:30.181
Inmen se har ek ko hum alag module mein cover karenge.

20
00:01:32.566 --> 00:01:38.240
Ye vendor console ka left menu hai. Ye groups mein banta hai: overview, inventory,

21
00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:42.806
Orders and dispatch, finance, warehouses and returns, aur account.

22
00:01:43.256 --> 00:01:48.397
Dashboard home page hai. Isme orders, sales aur live activity dikhti hai.

23
00:01:48.847 --> 00:01:54.590
Inventory mein vendor SKUs add karta hai, stock update karta hai aur price change

24
00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:55.866
Request karta hai.

25
00:01:56.316 --> 00:02:00.433
Orders mein naye orders accept, pick, pack aur dispatch hote hain.

26
00:02:00.883 --> 00:02:06.238
E-Way Bills high value orders ke liye hai, fifty thousand rupees aur usse oopra.

27
00:02:06.688 --> 00:02:11.765
Drivers and Fleet vendor ke apne local drivers aur vehicles ke liye hai.

28
00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:17.186
Earnings and Settlements mein payouts, deductions aur Tally export dikhta hai.

29
00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:21.967
Warehouses mein vendor ki har pickup location ki list hoti hai.

30
00:02:22.417 --> 00:02:28.113
Returns and Disputes mein customer ki return requests aur unka status dikhta hai.

31
00:02:28.563 --> 00:02:32.038
KYC mein approved business details dikhti hain.

32
00:02:32.038 --> 00:02:33.960
Ye ab sirf read only hain.

33
00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:39.253
Aur Settings mein password reset, staff accounts, aur privacy and data hai.

34
00:02:41.666 --> 00:02:47.419
Chaliye dashboard kholte hain. Login karne ke baad vendor ko sabse pehle yahi screen

35
00:02:47.419 --> 00:02:48.173
Dikhti hai.

36
00:02:48.623 --> 00:02:52.121
Orders. Selected period mein kul kitne orders aaye.

37
00:02:52.571 --> 00:02:58.355
G M V, yaani gross merchandise value. Jo kuch bika uski total value, kisi bhi

38
00:02:58.355 --> 00:02:59.782
Deduction se pahle.

39
00:03:00.232 --> 00:03:05.073
S L A rate. Kitne percent orders promised time ke andar handle huye.

40
00:03:05.073 --> 00:03:06.781
Jitna zyada, utna achha.

41
00:03:07.231 --> 00:03:13.226
A O V, yaani average order value. G M V ko orders ki ginti se divide karo.

42
00:03:13.676 --> 00:03:19.662
Ye chart revenue aur orders day by day dikhata hai, taaki vendor busy aur quiet days

43
00:03:19.662 --> 00:03:20.375
Dekh sake.

44
00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:26.943
Aur live activity latest events dikhati hai, jaise naya order, uske order I D aur

45
00:03:26.943 --> 00:03:28.227
Amount ke saatha.

46
00:03:30.633 --> 00:03:33.278
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

47
00:03:35.566 --> 00:03:40.782
Ye live session ka vendor dashboard hai. Upar ek welcome message aur vendor ki

48
00:03:40.782 --> 00:03:41.518
Rating hai.

49
00:03:44.266 --> 00:03:49.514
Chart pe hover karne se us din ka revenue aur orders ki ginti dikhti hai.

50
00:03:57.866 --> 00:04:02.687
Chart ke neeche live activity naye orders ko aate hi list karti hai.

51
00:04:08.266 --> 00:04:13.904
Neeche scroll karne pe warehouse capacity aur abhi kis pe action chahiye, wo dikhta

52
00:04:13.904 --> 00:04:14.175
Hai.

53
00:04:14.775 --> 00:04:19.612
Yahan se vendor Inventory mein jaata hai, jahan asli kaam shuru hota hai.

54
00:04:19.612 --> 00:04:21.666
Wo hum module two mein karenge.

55
00:04:23.466 --> 00:04:27.114
Aage badhne se pehle kuch words pakke kar lete hain.

56
00:04:27.564 --> 00:04:33.488
S K U, yaani stock keeping unit. Vendor ke liye ek S K U ka matlab hai ek product,

57
00:04:33.488 --> 00:04:37.100
Ek warehouse mein, uske stock aur price ke saatha.

58
00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:42.679
Master catalog. Saare products ki list. Products sirf admin banata hai.

59
00:04:42.679 --> 00:04:44.846
Vendor bas usme se chunta hai.

60
00:04:45.296 --> 00:04:51.099
G M V. Total bikri ki value, commission, refunds ya doosre deductions se pahle.

61
00:04:51.549 --> 00:04:56.157
S L A. Wo promised time jiske andar order handle hona chahiye.

62
00:04:56.607 --> 00:04:58.825
A O V. Average order value.

63
00:05:01.233 --> 00:05:05.116
Kuch aur words, zyadatar shipping aur paison ke baare men.

64
00:05:05.566 --> 00:05:10.962
Shiprocket. Oribrix ka main courier partner. Ye courier assign karta hai, warehouse

65
00:05:10.962 --> 00:05:13.758
Se pick up karta hai aur deliver karta hai.

66
00:05:14.208 --> 00:05:19.349
A W B, yaani air waybill. Courier jo tracking number shipment ko deta hai.

67
00:05:19.799 --> 00:05:25.730
E-way bill. Ek government transport document, jo fifty thousand rupees ya usse zyada

68
00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.778
Ka maal move hone pe chahiye.

69
00:05:28.228 --> 00:05:33.860
Settlement. Ek payout cycle, jismen vendor ki ek period ki kamayi pay out hoti hai.

70
00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:39.856
Aur Tally. Accounting software. Settlement data Tally ke liye export ho sakta hai.

71
00:05:42.266 --> 00:05:46.255
Oribrix ke vendor side pe teen tarah ke log kaam karte hain.

72
00:05:46.705 --> 00:05:53.027
Vendor ka main login roz ka kaam karta hai. Warehouses, S K Us, orders, e-way bills,

73
00:05:53.027 --> 00:05:54.833
Aur staff logins banana.

74
00:05:55.283 --> 00:06:00.830
Vendor staff sub logins hote hain. Unhe sirf wahi sections aur warehouses dikhte

75
00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:05.545
Hain jo main login allow karta hai. Wo doosre users nahi bana sakte.

76
00:06:05.995 --> 00:06:11.533
Aur admin, yaani Oribrix team, warehouses, price aur policy changes approve karti

77
00:06:11.533 --> 00:06:17.003
Hai, e-way bills review karti hai, aur vendor ko suspend ya block kar sakti hai.

78
00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:24.385
Vendor portal ka golden rule ye hai. Vendor propose karta hai, admin approve karta

79
00:06:24.385 --> 00:06:29.249
Hai. Naya warehouse, price change, warranty ya return policy change, e-way bill.

80
00:06:29.249 --> 00:06:33.869
Vendor submit karta hai, aur admin approval ke bina kuch bhi live nahi hota.

81
00:06:33.869 --> 00:06:38.976
Toh jab koi vendor poochhe ki mera change dikh kyun nahi raha, toh pehla sawaal yahi

82
00:06:38.976 --> 00:06:41.651
Hai: kya admin ne abhi tak approve kiya hai?

83
00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:34.709
Ye inventory page ka ek quick preview hai, jise hum module two mein detail mein

84
00:07:34.709 --> 00:07:35.303
Padhenge.

85
00:07:35.753 --> 00:07:39.635
Active S K Us. Ye vendor kitne products bech raha hai.

86
00:07:40.085 --> 00:07:43.819
Stock quantity. Saare S K Us milakar total units.

87
00:07:44.269 --> 00:07:49.389
Stock status breakdown. Kitne in stock hain, kitne low, aur kitne out of stock.

88
00:07:49.839 --> 00:07:53.252
Aur Add S K U button, jisse sab shuru hota hai.

89
00:07:55.666 --> 00:08:00.039
Aur ye orders page hai, jise hum module four mein cover karenge.

90
00:08:00.489 --> 00:08:05.289
Awaiting action. Naye orders jinhe vendor ko abhi accept karna hai.

91
00:08:05.739 --> 00:08:09.793
In fulfilment. Accepted orders jo pick aur pack ho rahe hain.

92
00:08:10.243 --> 00:08:13.720
On the road. Orders jo delivery ke liye nikal chuke hain.

93
00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:19.260
Aur neeche, har order, uske customer, warehouse, amount, payment aur status ke

94
00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:19.717
Saatha.

95
00:08:22.133 --> 00:08:27.372
Ek order ko customer se vendor tak follow karte hain, taaki saare sections saath

96
00:08:27.372 --> 00:08:32.742
Mein samajh aayen. Maan lijiye Lucknow mein ek contractor twenty bags cement order

97
00:08:32.742 --> 00:08:33.397
Karta hai.

98
00:08:33.847 --> 00:08:37.836
Contractor Oribrix customer app mein order place karta hai.

99
00:08:38.286 --> 00:08:44.095
System sabse paas wala approved warehouse dhoondhta hai jismen ye product stock mein

100
00:08:44.095 --> 00:08:44.302
Ho.

101
00:08:44.752 --> 00:08:50.611
Jis vendor ka wo warehouse hai, use vendor console pe sound aur pop-up alert milta

102
00:08:50.611 --> 00:08:50.896
Hai.

103
00:08:51.346 --> 00:08:55.336
Vendor items check karta hai aur order accept karta hai.

104
00:08:55.786 --> 00:09:01.342
Vendor maal pick aur pack karta hai, aur Shiprocket ya local driver ko hand over

105
00:09:01.342 --> 00:09:02.036
Karta hai.

106
00:09:02.486 --> 00:09:07.891
Order deliver hota hai, aur paisa agle settlement mein vendor tak pahunchta hai.

107
00:09:07.891 --> 00:09:10.998
Inmen se har step left menu ka ek section hai.

108
00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:18.910
Agar aap vendors ko support karte hain, toh ye paanch sawaal aapko baar baar sunne

109
00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:23.277
Ko milenge. Is course ke end tak aap in sabka jawaab de paayenge.

110
00:09:23.727 --> 00:09:29.084
Customers ko mera product kyun nahi dikh raha? Usually warehouse approved nahi hai,

111
00:09:29.084 --> 00:09:31.471
Intake paused hai, ya stock nahi hai.

112
00:09:31.921 --> 00:09:37.196
Mera naya warehouse abhi bhi pending kyun hai? Kyunki admin pehle pickup address

113
00:09:37.196 --> 00:09:39.900
Verify karta hai, phir approve karta hai.

114
00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:45.984
Mera price change apply kyun nahi hua? Wo admin approval ka wait kar raha hai, ya

115
00:09:45.984 --> 00:09:47.027
Reject ho gaya.

116
00:09:47.477 --> 00:09:50.970
Maine alert dismiss kiya, kya order cancel ho gaya?

117
00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:53.984
Nahin. Dismiss sirf alert ko chup karta hai.

118
00:09:54.434 --> 00:09:59.763
Aur main ab S K Us add kyun nahi kar paa raha? Ho sakta hai account suspend ho,

119
00:09:59.763 --> 00:10:01.922
Jisse wo read only ho jaata hai.

120
00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:08.578
Sab jodte hain. Ek achhe vendor ka din kuch aisa dikhta hai.

121
00:10:09.028 --> 00:10:12.868
Subah dashboard kholiye aur live activity check kijiye.

122
00:10:13.318 --> 00:10:19.185
Har naya order jaldi accept kijiye. Late accept se S L A rate kharab hota hai.

123
00:10:19.635 --> 00:10:22.451
Time pe pick, pack aur hand over kijiye.

124
00:10:22.901 --> 00:10:28.874
Fifty thousand rupees ya usse zyada ke orders ke liye e-way bill upload kijiye.

125
00:10:29.324 --> 00:10:34.367
Stock numbers sahi rakhiye. Agar app mein aisa stock dikhe jo hai hi nahi, toh

126
00:10:34.367 --> 00:10:37.794
Orders fail hote hain aur customers naaraz hote hain.

127
00:10:38.244 --> 00:10:42.254
Aur hafte mein ek baar returns aur settlements check kijiye.

128
00:10:44.666 --> 00:10:50.006
Quick check. Ek vendor ne kal price change request daali, lekin customers ko abhi

129
00:10:50.006 --> 00:10:53.434
Bhi purana price dikh raha hai. Kyun? Rukke sochiye.

130
00:10:57.384 --> 00:11:03.122
Answer: admin ne abhi tak approve nahi kiya. Vendor propose karta hai, admin approve

131
00:11:03.122 --> 00:11:03.805
Karta hai.

132
00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.160
Module one ko summarise karte hain.

133
00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:14.346
Ye course vendor ka KYC approve hone ke baad se shuru hota hai.

134
00:11:14.796 --> 00:11:18.295
Vendor console ke left menu mein ten sections hain.

135
00:11:18.745 --> 00:11:23.737
Dashboard mein orders, G M V, S L A rate aur A O V dikhte hain.

136
00:11:24.187 --> 00:11:28.752
Staff logins ko sirf wahi dikhta hai jo main login allow karta hai.

137
00:11:29.202 --> 00:11:33.681
Aur golden rule: vendor propose karta hai, admin approve karta hai.

138
00:11:33.681 --> 00:11:36.221
Module two mein hum stock add karenge.

139
00:11:38.633 --> 00:11:44.783
Module 1 yahin khatam hota hai. Agla hai module 2: Inventory, SKUs and change

140
00:11:44.783 --> 00:11:45.502
Requests.
